 "method": "Primary photon fluence ratio from exp(-mu*d) for the two lines (XCOM-type mu: 0.0650 and 0.0606 cm-1) averaged; scattered photon fluence/energy fluence from published Co-60 10x10 SSD100 buildup data (scattered fluence ~19%, energy fluence ~6%). Interaction fractions from Klein-Nishina plus parametrized Rayleigh/photoelectric/pair cross sections for water. Electron fluence obtained from kerma/stopping-power balance (Phi_e/Phi0 = D/(S_col x 1.602e-10)); electron spectra and angular distributions from Compton kinematics and electron multiple-scattering/CSDA estimates with explicit delta-ray fraction. D, K, Kcol from mu_en, mu_tr and g(T); beta = D/Kcol. s_w,air from IAEA TRS-398 (1.133, Delta=10 keV); PDD5 from BJR-25 Co-60 10x10 SSD100 tables.",
